      ],
      "source": "https://houstonborough.org/visitors/our-history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "When the Chartiers Valley Railroad arrived in 1871, David C. Houston saw a chance and mapped out Houstonville.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
