      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Houston%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The 1988 film The Prince of Pennsylvania shot scenes in Houston, including a house on S. McNary Street and Chartiers Houston High School.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
